        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L.O.S.T.</strong> is an intense cooperative survival action game where up to four players are trapped in a deadly location.<br>Your only chance is to complete the mission, hold back enemy waves, and survive until evacuation arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session is unique: your teamwork and decisions will determine whether you make it out alive — or remain forever lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>4-player online co-op</strong> — survive together with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚁 <strong>Different escape scenarios</strong> — refuel a helicopter, repair a ship, or reach the bus in time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Fight enemy hordes</strong> — use weapons, abilities, and tactics to push back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 <strong>Scavenge &amp; cooperate</strong> — gather supplies, repair transport, and protect your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕒 <strong>Fast-paced sessions</strong> — time is limited, and every choice matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 Add <strong>L.O.S.T.</strong> to your wishlist and be among the first to experience the thrill of survival!</p>",
